{"meta":{"id":"env-pm2","category":"it/server/backend/express/settings","title":"Express env 사용 (bat → pm2)","subtitle":"","summary":"bat 파일 → pm2 등록 → express 실행","tags":["express","node","env","pm2","bat"],"color":"emerald","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-emerald","source":"blog: code/back/ExpressEnvSetting.jsx","updatedAt":"2025-06-10"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-emerald-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>EXPRESS</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2025-06-10</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">Express env 사용 (bat → pm2)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> bat 파일 → pm2 등록 → express 실행</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-stone-100\">\r\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-800 font-semibold\">현재 상황</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">노트북 실행시, 시작 bat파일로 project bat파일 실행</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">project bat : pm2를 background에서 동작</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">nginx에서 backEnd를 proxy 연결</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">env.development 와 env.production으로 분리가 필요해져서 작업 진행 (cors 등록)</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">내부 코드 진행 순서</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">express-server.bat -&gt; ecosystem.config.js -&gt; server.js</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">노트북 로딩이 되면, bat 파일 동작하게 관리중</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">express-server.bat</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">@echo off\r\npushd &quot;C:\\작업 디렉토리 주소&quot;\r\nstart /B pm2 start ecosystem.config.js --env production\r\npopd\r\necho express server run\r\npause</pre></div>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">ecosystem.config.js (pm2 설정)</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">module.exports = {\r\n  apps: [\r\n    {\r\n      name: &#x27;express&#x27;,                     // PM2에서 표시될 앱 이름\r\n      script: &#x27;server.js&#x27;,                 // 실행할 메인 파일\r\n      cwd: &#x27; &#x27;,                             // 작업 디렉토리 주소 등록\r\n      watch: true,                         // 파일 변경 감지 시 자동 재시작\r\n      env: {\r\n        NODE_ENV: &#x27;development&#x27;,\r\n      },\r\n      env_production: {\r\n        NODE_ENV: &#x27;production&#x27;,\r\n      },\r\n      output: &#x27;주소/logs/out/back.log&#x27;,   // 일반 로그 파일\r\n      error: &#x27;주소/logs/err.back.log&#x27;,    // 에러 로그 파일\r\n      merge_logs: false,\r\n\r\n      max_memory_restart: &quot;1000M&quot;,// 메모리 1000MB 초과 시 프로세스 재시작\r\n    },\r\n\r\n  ]\r\n};</pre></div>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">server.js</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">require(&#x27;dotenv&#x27;).config(); // 공통 설정 항상 로드\r\n\r\nconst envMap = {\r\n  development: &#x27;.env.development&#x27;,\r\n  production: &#x27;.env.production&#x27;,\r\n};\r\n\r\nconst envMode = process.env.NODE_ENV;\r\n\r\nif (envMode &amp;&amp; envMap[envMode]) {\r\n  require(&#x27;dotenv&#x27;).config({ path: envMap[envMode], override: true });\r\n  console.log(`적용 env : ${envMap[envMode]}`);\r\n}</pre></div>\r\n</div>\r\n","path":"it/server/backend/express/settings/env-pm2","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"backend","title":"백엔드","path":"it/server/backend"},{"id":"express","title":"Express (Node.js)","path":"it/server/backend/express"},{"id":"settings","title":"설정 · 실행","path":"it/server/backend/express/settings"}],"hasImage":false}